{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/2/desc","kr_sha":"056f9cbb94b07e7823915898df5aedcb1cba6277bd13ee52c6664b16b03d885c","zh":"午間問候","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/2/dlg","kr_sha":"ff40890993ecdb93c8e859067ae69250e8c44a498f544abf43149b9115ced9d3","zh":"對不起，浮士德。因為收到關於經營藝廊相關的諮詢請求，我必須先去別的大師的藝廊一趟。原先預計於今天進行的作品批評，只能延後到明天了呢。\n在我回來前，藝廊就交給你了。特別是羅狄翁，別讓那個酒鬼踏進這裡一步……知道了嗎？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
