{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/4/desc","kr_sha":"43da8f2faf5af065a534f87945d13e2671f10c1f1b86cbf5539f9d5668181a0f","zh":"對話 1","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/4/dlg","kr_sha":"bf8d6f10468b3a86140859adee5e36b347f1bcbc8edebb2c24fa2b6c0a0e51f1","zh":"會造訪這條僻靜走廊的人，大概不會太多。但是……即使只是為了那些透過我的翡翠色眼瞳注視著的眾多觀眾，我也絕不能在作品管理上有所怠慢呢。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
