{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/5/desc","kr_sha":"ae22d4fc09a33be838e1721a7aa26d5dbd2dd2aab86575413ab771d478069747","zh":"對話 2","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/5/dlg","kr_sha":"740c3e9f6d7f059532560265c6f7eee9e34b1c2e77cfc2710ff9b82942298a79","zh":"「每道脈絡滴落青藍之色，每條筋脈滲出溫暖殷紅。」這是一首描寫靜脈和動脈對比的詩。\n雖然不及雕刻人體，但我喜歡作詩，因此將它作為一種興趣。若有心儀的作品，便會如這般題上一句詩。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
