{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/6/desc","kr_sha":"65e016ef58165be68acb39554fb899828842c8c1029509638e067da9d0efde1f","zh":"對話 3","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/6/dlg","kr_sha":"75f1f6c52f8505b186ad280874ad2fb6434feaa6918df21b6fbc125599c33084","zh":"過去，我曾憑著愚昧的知識，試圖剖開自己腦袋。我嘗試削切腦部，改變其量感。結果失敗了。如果我那時知道單憑手的觸感來觸碰大腦是件多困難的事……或許現在就不用像這樣用帽子遮掩身體了吧。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
