{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/7/desc","kr_sha":"e5d82a8beeb0245da4845fe51a4668374a236c0f0c6717796be8507a51eef742","zh":"同步後對話 1","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Honglu_KumoRings_10614.json|/dataList/7/dlg","kr_sha":"92e9d98fcd34a38ed6c367fbe4c5db8e7cea401e50b645b0e1eeae4a6da60e3c","zh":"在學習新事物時，我從不猶豫。野獸派的兇暴。立體派的冷血。點描派的執念。絕對派的純血。若悉心研究所有並反覆塗抹……說不定，能讓我創造出名留青史之作的靈感，又會再度眷顧於我吧？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
